      "retrieved": "2026-10-12",
      "revision": 1353609978,
      "text": "Cinchona officinalis is a South American tree in the family Rubiaceae. It is native to wet montane forests in Colombia, Ecuador, Peru and Bolivia, between 1600–2700 meters above sea level. It is the national tree of Peru."
    }
